    "explanation": "The exposure-weighted rate-level change is {{rate_level}}, while fixed-exposure premium impact is {{premium_impact}}. These differ because the former averages segment percentage changes by exposure; the latter compares modeled premium at fixed exposure. The reconciliation returned no deterministic findings.",
    "recommended_action": "Review the segment calculation inputs and confirm the exposure basis and premium-impact interpretation before relying on the portfolio view.",
