    },
    {
      "title": "Largest segment movements",
      "explanation": "The largest listed percentage movements are for PA020 and PA012, at {{pa020_change}} and {{pa012_change}}, respectively. These are segment rate changes, not portfolio premium impacts. Investigate the factor and base-rate inputs behind these movements and verify the intended segmentation.",
      "recommended_action": "Trace the inputs and rating-factor changes for PA020 and PA012, then compare with the documented filing rationale.",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "calc:PA020",
